<title>SPAIN: Workers paying Spain soc contribtions up 3.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Workers paying Spain soc contribtions up 3.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Social Security department said on Friday the number of workers paying social contributions rose by 106,010 to 13,028,185 in June.</p>
<p>This represents a rise of 3.37 percent year-on-year, with an addition of half a million workers paying social contributions since the beginning of the year.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 8340</p>
</text>
